        {
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/commits/0332af005c998ed6c7b45275c96faca83db082e2",
          "sha": "0332af005c998ed6c7b45275c96faca83db082e2",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/commit/0332af005c998ed6c7b45275c96faca83db082e2"
        }
      ],
      "message": "wallet, bdbro: Reject revisited overflow pages\n\nEnforcing overflow data lengths stops a chain whose pages carry data, but\noverflow pages that carry no data never advance the accumulated length, so\na chain that cycles through empty overflow pages loops forever. Keep track\nof the pages visited while following a chain and reject one that is seen\nagain.",
